{title: Poovaadai Kaatru}
{artist: Ilaiyaraaja}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
Poo [E] vaadai kaatru [Am] la la la,        Vandhu [Dm] aadai theendumae [Am] la la la
Mun [E] dhaanai ingae [Am] la la la,        Kudai [Dm] yaaga maarumae [Am] la la la
[Am] Saaral pattadhaal [Dm] poo vedikkumae,        [Am] Eera vandugal [Dm] thaen kudikkumae
[G] Aa.. aaa? [Am] ho,        [Am] Paadhai thadumaarum
Idhu bodhai mazhaiyaagum,        [E] Mundhaanai vaasam [Dm] yaedho su [E] gam
[A] Kaanaadha [Faug] poovin jaadhi,        [F#m] Nanaindhadhae [A] dhegam paadhi
[A] Thallaadum [F] kaadhal jothi,        [F#m] enna sae [F] dhi
Idhu [A] thaanae mogam Papappaa?        Oru poovin dhaagam Papappaa?
[A] Kudaiyodu [G] nanaiyaadho,        [F] poongaava [Am] nam
